	(text "Pull-ups: slave serial (M0 = M1 = M2 = 1) and CCLK parked high while the Mega is in reset.\n10k against the 1k series resistors: the Mega still pulls a pin to 0.45 V (TTL low < 0.8 V).\nThey go to VCC_FPGA, not +5V, so that they never feed a switched-off XC2064."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 67.564 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3033e523-8603-5da1-9ff8-bdb58f3e91c5")
	)
	(text "C1, C2 directly at the VCC pins 18 and 52."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.12 60.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "571e062c-77f3-5998-ba78-754e0f35a8bb")
	)
	(text "XC2064 in a PLCC68 socket (PC68), symbol pins arranged like the package seen from the top.\nConfiguration in slave serial mode: CCLK = Mega SCK (D52), DIN (P58) = Mega MOSI (D51),\nreadback data M1/RDATA = Mega MISO (D50). CCLK must not stay low for more than 5 us.\nAfter configuration the XC2064 has no pull-ups: unused pads are held by the Mega."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 245.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ae6730c4-85fa-5617-9f86-a7f4ab911e5a")
	)
